WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.168
♪♪

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:05.130
(Footsteps)

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.342
♪♪

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:09.092
Allie:
We've made it.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:16.975
♪♪

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.769
Everything's going to be
different from now on. 

00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:21.563
♪♪

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:25.525
Margot:
You want to make this a home,
whether we like it or not.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:30.155
♪Children born to get high,
Turn your heads to the sky♪

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.448
♪♪

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:33.742
Isela:
It took a long time for this
place to find its footing.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:35.702
♪♪

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:38.789
Isela:
And I took a very personal risk
bringing you here, Allie.

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:39.790
(Bell rings)

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:42.084
Please, don't make me regret
that choice.

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:45.170
♪♪

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.047
Allie:
You don't want to stay here with
me.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.465
♪♪

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.175
Allie:
I just want to keep everyone
safe.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.510
♪♪

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.388
Margot:
Look at you, thinking you've got
all the answers.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:55.973
♪♪

00:00:55.973 --> 00:00:59.393
♪Thor thunder crack your
hearing♪

00:00:59.393 --> 00:01:02.020
♪♪

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.357
People don't change, Allie, they
just reveal themselves over
time.

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:09.486
♪♪

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:10.612
We need to leave.

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:11.613
Allie:
What's wrong?

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:14.032
It's something we can never come
back from.

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:14.783
♪♪

00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:15.909
Margot's gonna be a problem.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.703
♪♪

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.079
Margot:
I've got to get us out of here.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:20.747
You burn that bridge.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:25.919
♪♪

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:28.588
Directory assistance.
Washington, DC.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:29.589
Margot?

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:30.841
♪♪

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:32.217
Man on phone:
Why would I want to help you?

00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:36.305
♪♪

00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:39.808
Because if you do, I'll give you
what you want.

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:43.437
♪♪

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:49.776
♪Lookin' for the rain to fall♪

